	<tr class="titlebg">
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="15%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/topic/veryhot_post.gif" alt="" />
			Author
		</td>
		<td valign="middle" align="left" width="85%" style="padding-left: 6px;">
			Topic: Person who made a big impact on your EQ life &nbsp;(Read 3802 times)
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=688" title="View the profile of Kimentari">Kimentari</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=688"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:sbranin@sbcglobal.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg8953#msg8953"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg8953#msg8953">Person who made a big impact on your EQ life</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> July 02, 2004, 11:14:50 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />I just rejoined this board and while I was looking around, I ran across the post of players that made a memorable bad impact on you.&nbsp; Well, this has me disturbed in that there are more blacklisted players than there are of the ones who have made a nice impact on.<br /><br />So, I guess I will start this off with a good note........<br /><br />Not exactly sure who would have made the most impact in my EQ career since I barely ever make enemies (try to anyway).&nbsp; &nbsp;Pepa has always been my RL and EQ best friend.&nbsp; We can vent at each other or just cry on each others shoulder (or screen for that matter).&nbsp; Phad, for some reason, will see me log on, and just automatically know if I have had a rough day and send me a &quot;HUGS!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!&quot;&nbsp; This always puts a smile on my face and takes a bit of pressure off of this ol&#039; ladies shoulders.&nbsp; <br /><br />Pretty much just getting online made me smile and laugh.&nbsp; I left the game in December to spend more time with my family during the holidays and be a mom.&nbsp; I started working at home pretty much from sun up until sun down.&nbsp; Now I am at a point in my life where I can relax a bit at night and I miss all of my friends.... LOOK OUT EQ I am BAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACK!!!!!<br /><br />Oh yea, Sineral and Tilien.....Just beware..................
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8958"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
