							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							KIME!!!! You better look for me whenever you get a chance to logon.  Glad to see you didn&#039;t quit and was just taking a break. HUGS!! <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /><br /><br />As for the topic the one person that made the biggest impact was a wizard named Bigsby.&nbsp; We met in CB back in the day and always hung out doing quests and killings things we had no business associated with.&nbsp; Great times.
