							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=902.msg9005#msg9005">Quote from: Nosterafu on July 05, 2004, 02:46:28 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Hey Lor you seen Hhaje around or have anyway of contacting him would really like to say hey to him and see how lifes been treating him<br /></div><br /><br />Im sorry, no i don&#039;t ../sigh&nbsp; &nbsp;last I saw him was on the old umbram site, he posted that he was playing something else and his char name, but my brother had said a few weeks earlier that he&#039;d stoped playing for months at a time before... so i wasn&#039;t too worried.&nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />Now i could kick my butt from here to kingdom come .... one day he was there, next day he ws gone.. /cry<br /><br />And sorry for not repsonding sooner -- been a funny ole week.<br /><br />But, hopelfull i finally learned his lessons .. and still visit those old haunts... and Lora stilll misses him every time she clicks them jboots..<br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
